                            Connect with Your
                            <span class="highlight">Campus Community</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="hero-description">
                            Join the conversation, share your thoughts, and stay connected with fellow students
                            from your campus. UConnect brings your university community together in one place.
                        </p>
                        <div class="hero-actions">
                            <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
                                🎓
                                Join Your Campus
                            </a>
                            <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">
                                ➡️
                                Sign In
                            </a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="hero-note">
                            🔒
