                            <div class="demo-info card-info">
                                <span class="demo-name">Ekansh Dhiman</span>
                                <span class="demo-campus">Tech Lead</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="demo-content card-content">Organizing a coding bootcamp this weekend. Free for all CS students! Register now 💻</p>
